WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Compare cleaner and host counts
Captioned sample walkthrough. Fictional Larkspur Cottage. Actual sample PDF excerpts; no customer footage.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Record what was found
The cleaner writes actual counts beside the expected quantities.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Compare at handover
The host sheet has expected, cleaner-found, host-checked and difference columns.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Ten counted-item rows
Adapt the list to your property. Knives, forks and spoons share one row, with eight expected of each.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Keep consumables separate
The restock sheet uses par, reorder-below and stock-today fields.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:38.000
What this does not prove
People complete the printed blanks. This kit does not automatically track stock or identify who lost an item.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Inspect the free sample
Free Letter/A4 sample sheets are linked below. Editable offline generator: payhip.com/b/jonH5 ($29).
